  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "level": 0,
      "markdown": "A comprehensive directory listing for Marine Corps Community Services at Quantico, Virginia, featuring contact information for various facilities, programs, and services organized alphabetically.\n\n**Facilities and Services Include:**\n\n- Recreation: Auto Skills Center, Barber Physical Activity Center, Leatherneck Lanes, Medal of Honor Golf Course, Quantico Pool\n- Dining: Bulldogs Burgers, Dunkin', McDonald's, Papa Johns, Subway, The Greek Squad, Quigley's locations\n- Retail: Main Exchange, DEA Exchange, FBI Exchange, OCS Exchange, WTBN Exchange, Marine Marts, Uniform Shop\n- Lodging: C Suites at Quantico, Inns of the Corps Quantico, Marine Lodge Quantico Liversedge\n- Child and Youth Services: CDC North, CDC South, Family Child Care, School-Age Care\n- Support Programs: Community Counseling, Family Advocacy, EFMP, Personal Financial Management, Transition Readiness, Voluntary Education\n- Entertainment: Little Hall Theater, Movies\n- Other Services: Base Library, Post Offices, Catering, Medical services"
    }
  ],
